{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf19 Siren's Well 2 \u2013 The Dream World Returns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story continues 18 years after the events of <i>Siren's Well</i>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>new era of horror</strong> awaits: In <i>Siren's Well 2</i>, return to the mysterious town of Siren's Well\u2014now the stage for an all\u2011new tale. Step into the shoes of two new protagonists as they uncover hidden truths while facing a terrifying, never\u2011before\u2011seen threat: the dreadful <strong>Crowley Family</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd6f About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through haunting locations filled with oppressive atmosphere, disturbing mysteries, and twisted fears. Players will confront their own traumas while resisting the sinister influence of the Crowleys, whose presence warps reality and spreads terror throughout the so\u2011called &quot;town of dreams&quot;: <i>Siren's Well</i>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A completely new standalone narrative \u2013 perfect for both newcomers and series veterans  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A plot rich in details, secrets, and hidden connections\u2014just like the previous games  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Two main scenarios with four unique story paths, choices, and consequences  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Female protagonists:  <br>\u2003\u2014 <strong>Naomi Chen (Chen Yamei / \u9673\u96c5\u7f8e)</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999510/extras/9e03d0027e6976d407f22c971fbdb0cf.poster.avif?t=1771601904\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999510/extras/9e03d0027e6976d407f22c971fbdb0cf.webm?t=1771601904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  <br>\u2003\u2014 <strong>Ellie Chen (Chen Yuling / \u9673\u7389\u73b2)</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999510/extras/6f71698e92494f78ca029df9676f85f0.poster.avif?t=1771601904\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999510/extras/6f71698e92494f78ca029df9676f85f0.webm?t=1771601904\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fresh antagonist: <strong>The Crowley Family</strong>, embodying pure psychological terror  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic horror with a touch of twisted humor inspired by 80s cult films \ud83c\udfac  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Creative puzzles and impactful decisions \ud83d\udd11  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Firearms for human enemies \ud83d\udd2b  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Smartphone as a crucial tool in the dream world \ud83d\udcf1  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 Evolution and Expansion of the Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Siren's Well 2</i> marks the beginning of a brand\u2011new saga, introducing original characters, a reimagined setting, and subtle connections with past titles\u2014further expanding the dark and immersive <strong>Siren\u2019s Well universe</strong>.  </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nudity in this game works <strong>differently</strong> than in previous titles. Now, to reveal a character\u2019s nudity, simply <i>remove the clothes she is wearing</i>. But keep in mind: a <strong>completely nude</strong> character is much more vulnerable to enemy attacks than one wearing clothes. ^^ \ud83d\udd25</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will also find <strong>clothing items</strong> scattered throughout the game environment. Each time you start a <i>&quot;New Game+&quot;</i> playthrough, new clothing pieces will appear in different locations to discover. And that\u2019s not all\u2014there are <strong>other surprises</strong> waiting for you... \ud83c\udf81\ud83d\udc57</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999510?t=1771601904","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999510/cc46cb44ce0b534a575b2ae0c1a8a02ff684d710/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771601904","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999510/9b6cdd5078637d56ffd41340a834f6c94ba0019b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771601904","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999510/9b6cdd5078637d56ffd41340a834f6c94ba0019b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771601904","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"This game explores a disturbing blend of horror, tension, and forbidden desire. While its core focus is psychological and survival horror, it also contains optional adult elements, including explicit imagery in paintings, scenes involving sexual intercourse, and suggestive dialogue.\r\n\r\nExplicit visual content is optional and can be managed through the settings menu.\r\nPlayer discretion is advised."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4160480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf19 Sire